# 2. MASTER CONCEPT

The major connection between malware analysis and forensics is:

```text
                 SECURITY INCIDENT
                        ↓
                 Suspicious Activity
                        ↓
              ┌─────────┴─────────┐
              ↓                   ↓
        MALWARE ANALYSIS      DIGITAL FORENSICS
              ↓                   ↓
        What does it do?      What happened?
              ↓                   ↓
        Behavior/Code          Evidence/Timeline
              ↓                   ↓
              └─────────┬─────────┘
                        ↓
                   CORRELATION
                        ↓
                   CONCLUSION
                        ↓
                 REMEDIATION
                        ↓
                     REPORT
```

### Easy memory:

> **Malware analysis = What does the malware do?**

> **Forensics = What happened on the system?**

